>**{c=red:You may have to change zones after completing }{q:Fire and Brimstone|Fire and Brimstone|Fire and Brimstone}{c=red: to start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Perih Vashai} in {z:Windurst Woods} (K-7) for a cutscene where she will tell you to go to {z:Mhaura}.
* In {z:Mhaura} speak twice with {n:Koh Lenbalalako} (F-9) for a cutscene. She will ask you for a {i:Gold Earring|Gold Earring|13315}. Trade it to her for a second cutscene and get the key item {k:Koh's letter}.
** {i:Gold Earring|Gold Earring|13315} can be obtained for free by completing the {p: RoE - Conflict: Xarcabard|Records of Eminence} objective for the first time.
* Zone into {z:Xarcabard} for a cutscene hinting to look near {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys}.
** Most convenient warp is {p:Survival Guide} - {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys}
* Find the cave at (E-7) in {z:Xarcabard} and examine the **???** where you will get another cutscene and then a {m:Koenigstiger} will pop. Defeat it.
** If you are doing multiple, everyone must get their own cutscene and kill. It has a ~3 minute repop.
* Now head south to the cave at (E-8) and check the **???** here for another cutscene.
* After the cutscene is over, check the **???** again for 99 {p:Ice Arrows|Ice Arrow}.
* Head back to {z:Windurst Woods} and talk once more to {p:Perih Vashai} for the final cutscene and your reward.

